message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "CKAN2HPC-Client"
abstract: >-
  Python client that transfers large scientific datasets between CKAN data
  portals and HPC storage over SFTP and the CKAN API, with SHA-256 integrity
  checks, compression, deduplication and retry with exponential back-off.
